    "description": "Hail: Probability of hail, expressed as a percentage POH and maximum expected severe hail size in cm MESHS. Updated every 5 minutes and every day, available for the last 14 days. Hail products are only calculated between April 1st and September 30th. All files published outside this period (e.g., in winter) are empty.",
